17592186045417] [17592186265475 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265475 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265475 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186263707 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265475 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "82b1bccb-f245-5952-bbe0-74fd47a6963c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263073 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263928 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264230 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264645 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264646 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186263073 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265512 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "93ddfe34-8e2a-5c0d-ad1d-5d50a7d04569" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263250 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263271 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263687 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264636 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186265001 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186265001 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265678 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f0ef6581-d8af-5b79-a84d-4f8dc281dbef" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186265512 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1069 "q-130257" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the directional derivative of the function $f(x,y)=xy$ at the point $(2,1)$ in the direction of the vector $v=\\sqrt{3}\\,i+j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5e9cc9e7-1d62-51d1-8fa2-dd51fa7daa28" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265867 #edb/ref 1074 "The directional derivative ${f}_{u}^{′}(a,b)$ of a function $f(x,y)$ at the point $(a,b)$ in the direction of the vector $v$ is given by\n\n$$\n{f}_{u}^{′}(a,b)=∇f(a,b)\\cdot u\n$$\n\nwhere $u$ is a unit vector in the direction of $v.$\n\nFirst, we find the unit vector $u$ in the direction of $v:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}+{1}^{2}}=2 \\\\ u & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}\\,i+j)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the gradient $∇f(x,y)$ and evaluate it at the point $(2,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xy)\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(xy)\\text{ }j \\\\  & =y\\,i+x\\,j \\\\ ∇\\,f(2,1) & =i+2\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the directional derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{u}^{′}(2,1) & =∇\\,f(2,1)\\cdot u \\\\  & =(i+2\\,j)\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}\\,i+j) \\\\  & =\\frac{1(\\sqrt{3})+2(1)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+2}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186265433 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1069 "q-130263" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the directional derivative of the function $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-xy$ at the point $(1,1)$ in the direction of the vector $v=i-j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ae068a0a-3a23-5516-a4b7-13c70903e5db" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265869 #edb/ref 1074 "The directional derivative ${f}_{u}^{′}(a,b)$ of a function $f(x,y)$ at the point $(a,b)$ in the direction of the vector $v$ is given by\n\n$$\n{f}_{u}^{′}(a,b)=∇f(a,b)\\cdot u\n$$\n\nwhere